## 🚀 Step 1: 添加配置

打开 `configs/config.yaml`，添加以下配置：

```yaml
# ============ JWT 配置 ============
jwt:
  enabled: true
  algorithm: "{{.Config.algorithm}}"
{{- if or (eq .Config.algorithm "HS256") (eq .Config.algorithm "HS384") (eq .Config.algorithm "HS512")}}
  # ⚠️ 重要：请更换为你自己的密钥！
  secret: "your-super-secret-key-change-me-in-production"
{{- else}}
  # RSA 密钥文件路径
  private_key_path: "./keys/private.pem"
  public_key_path: "./keys/public.pem"
{{- end}}
  
  access_token:
    ttl: {{.Config.access_token_ttl}}
    issuer: "your-app"
    audience: "your-app-users"
  
{{- if .Config.enable_refresh_token}}
  refresh_token:
    enabled: true
    ttl: 168h  # 7 天
{{- else}}
  refresh_token:
    enabled: false
{{- end}}
  
  blacklist:
{{- if eq .Config.blacklist_storage "disabled"}}
    enabled: false
{{- else}}
    enabled: true
    storage: "{{.Config.blacklist_storage}}"
{{- if eq .Config.blacklist_storage "redis"}}
    redis_key_prefix: "jwt:blacklist:"
{{- else}}
    cleanup_interval: 1h
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
  
  security:
    enable_jti: true
    enable_not_before: false
    clock_skew: 60s
```

### 💡 配置说明

| 配置项 | 说明 | 默认值 |
|--------|------|--------|
| `algorithm` | 签名算法 | HS256 |
| `secret` | 对称密钥 (HS*) | - |
| `access_token.ttl` | Access Token 有效期 | 2h |
| `refresh_token.ttl` | Refresh Token 有效期 | 168h |
| `blacklist.storage` | 黑名单存储 (memory/redis) | memory |

